@prefix dsrust: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/dsrust#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Source-grounded correction: dsrust::Parallel is exported at the admitted source, but it does
# not implement dsrust::Module. It is an execution helper whose run() consumes a set of
# (&dyn Module, Example) branches. Model that distinction explicitly instead of widening Module.

dsrust:ExecutionPolicy a rdfs:Class ;
  rdfs:label "DsRust execution policy" ;
  rdfs:comment "A non-Module execution helper exported by DsRust. At the admitted source, Parallel is the sole supported kind." .

# dsrust:name and dsrust:kind are intentionally reused from ontology.ttl. maxInFlight is likewise
# reused because it maps exactly to Parallel::new(max_in_flight). No work items or Examples are
# modeled here: selecting/constructing the policy is safe; supplying work and calling run() belongs
# to the consumer runtime authority domain.
